{# ORTAK ÇEKİRDEK — kimlik. Her formatta AYNI parçadan çizilir.
   Gereken context: c (ChannelConfig)

   DİL KİLİTLİ: kanalın dili kurulumda belirlenir ve sonradan değiştirilmesi
   DNA'yı, dil paketini, ses seçimini ve konu bankasını tutarsız bırakır. Salt
   okunur göstermek, açılırın ilk seçeneğe düşüp kanalı sessizce Türkçeye
   çevirmesi tuzağını da kapatır (Japonca kanal kurulurken yakalandı). #}
<div class="bg-white border border-claude-border rounded-xl shadow-soft">
  <div class="px-5 py-3 border-b border-claude-border bg-claude-surface rounded-t-xl">
    <h2 class="font-serif text-base font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="opacity-70">◈</span> Kimlik
      <span class="ml-auto text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-wider text-claude-subtle font-sans font-semibold">ortak</span>
    </h2>
  </div>
  <div class="px-5 py-4 space-y-3">
    <label class="block">
      <span class="text-xs text-claude-muted">Kanal adı</span>
      <input type="text" name="name" value="{{ c.name|e }}"
             class="bg-claude-surface border border-claude-border px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg w-full text-sm mt-1">
    </label>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
      <label class="block">
        <span class="text-xs text-claude-muted">Dil</span>
        <div class="bg-claude-surface-alt border border-claude-border px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm mt-1
                    flex items-center justify-between gap-2 text-claude-muted">
          <span>{% for kod, ad in LANGUAGES %}{% if kod == c.language %}{{ ad }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-claude-subtle">kilitli</span>
        </div>
      </label>
      <label class="block">
        <span class="text-xs text-claude-muted">Slug</span>
        <div class="bg-claude-surface-alt border border-claude-border px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm mt-1
                    font-mono text-xs text-claude-muted flex items-center h-[34px]">{{ c.slug }}</div>
      </label>
    </div>

    <label class="block">
      <span class="text-xs text-claude-muted">YouTube handle</span>
      <input type="text" name="handle" value="{{ c.handle|e }}"
             class="bg-claude-surface border border-claude-border px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg w-full text-sm mt-1 font-mono text-xs">
    </label>
  </div>
</div>
